<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica de Argentina.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telefonica de Argentina.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter said analyst Luiz Carvalho downgraded Telefonica de Argentina SA to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- in a report cited weaker-than-expected third quarter revenues.</p>
<p>-- said American Depositary Recepits had reached $36 price target.</p>
<p>-- lowered 1997 earnings per ADR estimate to $1.87 from $2.21 and dropped 1998 estimate to $2.27 from $2.42 &quot;to reflect a diminished earnings outlook.&quot;</p>
<p>-- ADRs closed Monday at 38-8/16.</p>
</text>
